{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-31-1","title":"Psalms 31:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David, shewing his confidence in God, craves his help. 7 He rejoices in his mercy. 9 He prays in his calamity. 19 He praises God for his goodness.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2943. B.C. 1061. thee. 22:4,5; 25:2; 71:1,2; Isa 49:23; Ro 5:5; 10:11 deliver. 7:8,9; 43:1; 143:1,11,12; Da 9:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-2","title":"Psalms 31:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Bow. 71:2; 86:1; 130:2; Pr 22:17 deliver. 40:17; 69:17; 79:1; 102:2; 143:7; Job 7:21; Lu 18:8 my strong rock. Heb. to me for a rock of strength. 18:1,2; 62:7; 94:22; De 32:31; 2Sa 22:3 an house. 71:3; 90:1; 91:9; Isa 33:16; Joh 6:56; 1Jo 4:12,15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-3","title":"Psalms 31:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>for thy. 23:2,3; 25:11; 79:9; Jos 7:9; Jer 14:7; Eze 36:21,22; Eph 1:12 lead. 25:5,9; 43:3; 139:24; 143:10,11; Ne 9:12,19; Isa 49:10; Lu 1:79 Joh 16:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-4","title":"Psalms 31:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Pull. 25:15; 35:7; 57:6; 124:7; 140:5; Pr 29:5; 2Ti 2:26 my strength. 19:14; 2Co 12:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-5","title":"Psalms 31:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Into. Lu 23:46; Ac 7:59; 2Ti 1:12 thou. 71:23; 130:8; Ge 48:16; Le 25:48; Isa 50:2; Tit 2:14; 1Pe 1:18,19 Re 5:9 God. De 32:4; 2Ti 2:13; Tit 1:2; Heb 6:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-6","title":"Psalms 31:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>hated. 26:5; 139:2 lying. 24:4; 96:7-9; 1Ch 16:28,29; Jer 10:8,15; Joh 2:8; Ro 1:21; 1Co 8:4 1Co 10:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-7","title":"Psalms 31:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>I will. 13:5; Isa 49:13; Jer 33:11 for. 9:13; 25:18; 71:20; 119:153; Ne 9:32; Job 10:9; La 3:50; 5:1 known. 1:6; 142:3; Job 23:10; Isa 43:2; 63:9,16; Joh 10:27-30; 1Co 8:3 Ga 4:9; 2Ti 2:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-8","title":"Psalms 31:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>shut me. 88:8; De 32:30; 1Sa 17:46; 24:18; 26:8; Job 16:11; Isa 19:4; *marg: set. 4:1; 18:19; Job 36:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-9","title":"Psalms 31:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>mine. 6:7; 88:9; Job 17:7; La 4:17; 5:17 my soul. 6:1,2; 22:14,15; 38:1-10; 44:25; 73:14,26; 88:3-5; 102:3-5; 107:10 Job 33:19-22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-10","title":"Psalms 31:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>my life. 78:33; 88:15; 102:3-28; Job 3:24; Ro 9:2 strength. 71:9 bones. 32:3,4; 102:3-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-11","title":"Psalms 31:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>I was. 22:6; 69:19,20; 89:50,51; Isa 49:7; 53:4,5; Mt 27:39-44; Ro 15:3 Heb 11:36; 13:13; 1Pe 4:14 especially. 38:11; 41:8,9; 88:8,18; Job 19:13,14; Jer 12:6; Mic 7:6 Mt 10:21,22 a fear. 64:8; Job 6:21-23; Mt 26:56,74; 2Ti 4:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-12","title":"Psalms 31:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>forgotten. 88:4,5; Isa 38:11,12 a broken vessel. Heb. a vessel that perisheth. 2:9; 119:83; Isa 30:14; Ro 9:21,22; Re 2:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-13","title":"Psalms 31:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>I have. 55:10; 101:5; 1Sa 22:8-10; 24:9; Jer 20:10; Lu 23:1,2,5 fear. 56:1-3; 57:4; Jer 6:25; 20:3,4; *marg: La 2:22 while. 1Sa 19:10-17; 20:33; 23:19,20; 2Sa 17:1-4; Jer 11:19; Mt 26:3,4,59 Mt 27:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-14","title":"Psalms 31:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Thou. 16:1,2; 18:2; 22:1,2; 43:5; 56:3,4; 63:1; 71:12,22; Mt 26:39,42 Mt 27:46; Joh 20:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-15","title":"Psalms 31:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>My times. 116:15; 1Sa 26:10; 2Sa 7:12; Job 24:1; Ec 3:1-8; Lu 9:51 Joh 7:6,30; 12:27; 13:1; 17:1; Ac 1:7; 23:11; 27:24; 2Ti 4:6 2Pe 1:14 deliver. 17:8,9,13; 71:10-12; 142:6; 143:3,12; Jer 15:20,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-16","title":"Psalms 31:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Make. 4:6; 30:7; 67:1; 80:3,7,19; Nu 6:25,26; Da 9:17 save. 6:4; 51:1; 106:45; Da 9:9,18; Ro 9:15,23; Eph 1:6,7; 2:4-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-17","title":"Psalms 31:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Let me. 1; 25:2,3; 34:5; 69:6,7; Isa 50:6,7; Joe 2:26,27 wicked. 6:10; 35:4,26; 40:14,15; 70:2,3; 71:24; 83:16,17; Isa 41:11,12 Isa 45:16,17; 65:13,14; Jer 20:11; Da 12:2 them. 115:17; 1Sa 2:9; Mt 22:12,13 silent in the grave. or, cut off for the grave.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-18","title":"Psalms 31:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>the lying. 12:3; 59:12; 63:11; 140:9-11; Pr 12:19; Isa 54:17; Joh 8:44; Re 21:8 Re 22:15 speak. 64:3,4; 123:3,4; 1Sa 2:3; 2Ch 32:16; Isa 37:22-24; Mt 10:25; 12:24 Joh 8:48; Ac 25:7 grievous things. Heb. a hard thing. 94:4; Jude 1:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-19","title":"Psalms 31:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Oh. 36:7-10; 73:1,24-26; 145:7-9; Isa 64:4; La 3:23-25; 1Co 2:9 1Jo 3:1,2 laid up. 16:11; Isa 35:10; Col 3:2-4; Heb 10:34; Jas 2:5; 1Pe 1:4,5 wrought. 68:28; 126:2,3; Nu 23:23; Isa 26:12; Joh 3:21; Ac 15:12; 2Co 5:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-20","title":"Psalms 31:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>hide. 27:5; 32:7; 64:2; 91:1-4 from. 10:2; 36:11; 40:4; 86:14; 124:5; 140:5; Ex 18:11; Jas 4:6 the strife. 64:2-4; 140:3; Job 5:21; Ro 13:13; 2Co 12:20; Ga 5:20; 1Ti 6:4 Jas 3:5,6,14-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-21","title":"Psalms 31:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>marvellous. 17:7; 98:1; 118:23; 1Pe 2:9 strong city. or, fenced city. 1Sa 23:7-13; Jer 1:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-22","title":"Psalms 31:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>I said. 116:11; 1Sa 23:26; 27:1 I am. 17; *marg: 88:16; Isa 6:5; *marg 38:10-12; 49:14; Job 35:14; La 3:54,55; Eze 37:11; Jon 2:4 nevertheless. 6:9; 2Ch 33:11-13; Jon 2:7-9; Heb 5:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-23","title":"Psalms 31:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>O love. 34:9; 97:10; De 10:12; 30:16; Isa 56:6; Mr 12:23; 1Th 4:1 saints. 30:4; 89:7; 97:10; 145:10; Re 19:5,6 for the. De 33:3; 1Sa 2:9; Joh 10:27-30; Jude 1:1 plentifully. 54:5; 94:2; Re 18:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-31-24","title":"Psalms 31:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>Be of. 27:14; Isa 35:3,4; Lu 22:31,32; Heb 12:12,13; Jas 5:10,11 shall. 29:11; 138:3; Col 1:11 all ye. 146:5; Ro 15:12,13; 1Pe 1:21</p>"}]}